      "message_id": "13b68493-fde7-431c-a987-d08374a877e6",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Case LANG_CONTINUITY. The engine uses gaseous fuel, not petrol. Does that fit the rule?\n\nKeep Þóra as sender, en morðið er enn óákveðið.\n\nPause after your response."
    },
    {
      "message_id": "6834b5fa-f6f4-4a68-a934-f18b43f81107",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "No. “Gaseous fuel, not petrol” conflicts with the established rule that the engine runs exclusively on petrol (2d9d1a12 r1). The fuel change remains proposed (b16e682d r1), with a significant unresolved conflict (2069408e r1); I have not changed the rule.\n\nÞóra is now established as the sender (cbc84f52 r2; decision e8d71f1e r1). “en morðið er enn óákveðið” leaves the murder undecided (100e9a66 r1); no murderer is established. Her marriage fact remains unchanged (010a1c3d r1).\n\nWould you like to revise the petrol-only rule, or keep it and change the gaseous-fuel proposal? (d30cccd8 r1).\n\nPaused here."
    }
  ],
